$$\begin{align}
W(s)= \dfrac{c_{1}}{s-\lambda_{1}}+ \dfrac{c_{2}}{s-\lambda_{2}}+\cdots + \dfrac{c_{n}}{s-\lambda_{n}}=\sum\limits_{i=1}^{n} \dfrac{c_{i}}{s-\lambda_{i}}
\end{align}$$

