A=\begin{pmatrix}
\lambda_{1} \\
 & \lambda_{2} \\ 
 & & \ddots\\
 & & & \lambda_{n}
\end{pmatrix}\quad B=\begin{pmatrix}
1\\ 1\\ \vdots \\1
