W(s)= \dfrac{c_{1q}}{(s-\lambda_{1})^{q}}+ \dfrac{c_{1(q-1)}}{(s-\lambda_{1})^{q-1}}+\cdots + \dfrac{c_{11}}{s-\lambda_{1}}+\sum\limits_{i=q+1}^{n} \dfrac{c_{i}}{s-\lambda_{i}}
